{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blunderworld</strong>\u00a0is a roguelike where you shoot a disc around a board to take over Hell. Inspired by games like carrom, crokinole, and coin pushers, Blunderworld asks: &quot;What if you could shoot a disc and watch a big number increase at the same time?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/2a8e2dae91c7ea3ada25e5d828299e8d.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an alchemist who plans on overthrowing Hell with their Opus. Knock out as many pieces as you can to collect Souls and pass each level's goal. As you delve deeper, you'll collect Pacts that power up your Opus. Summon hordes of pieces, create powerful board effects, and of course, rack up game-breaking multipliers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/984483e5718dfb7745e409798e6f2338.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your gold to purchase upgrades and guide your build towards victory. Or gamble it all away at the roulette wheel. The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/bd34452aca0a9b7eb497f8a6b4999b0b.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to take the throne of Hell, you'll need to conquer the Lords of Sin. Each layer of Hell has a unique boss with their own special mechanics, personality, and evolving dialogue. The Lords will push your build to its limits, so be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What To Expect From The Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives you access to the first 3 layers of Hell. The rest of the game, such as ability unlocks and challenge modes/daily run are only available in the full version.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077620?t=1760413047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4077620?t=1760413047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/5fbd432d240ba87fcd144b10f5248b0b9b707cb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760413047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/5fbd432d240ba87fcd144b10f5248b0b9b707cb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760413047","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/be6cc2de0c0162d341c43a1b26f316f2.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blunderworld</strong>\u00a0is a roguelike where you shoot a disc around a board to take over Hell. Inspired by games like carrom, crokinole, and coin pushers, Blunderworld asks: &quot;What if you could shoot a disc and watch a big number increase at the same time?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/2a8e2dae91c7ea3ada25e5d828299e8d.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/488a455d2af7ea50b0b37f05c63bfb0f.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an alchemist who plans on overthrowing Hell with their Opus. Knock out as many pieces as you can to collect Souls and pass each level's goal. As you delve deeper, you'll collect Pacts that power up your Opus. Summon hordes of pieces, create powerful board effects, and of course, rack up game-breaking multipliers.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/984483e5718dfb7745e409798e6f2338.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/5094a44107b036c97a809a20dfb238f6.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your gold to purchase upgrades and guide your build towards victory. Or gamble it all away at the roulette wheel. The choice is entirely yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/bd34452aca0a9b7eb497f8a6b4999b0b.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1402 height=307 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.poster.avif?t=1760413047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.webm?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/extras/1e3d80e8ff1b7c05429cfb573bad961a.mp4?t=1760413047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to take the throne of Hell, you'll need to conquer the Lords of Sin. Each layer of Hell has a unique boss with their own special mechanics, personality, and evolving dialogue. The Lords will push your build to its limits, so be prepared!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What To Expect From The Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives you access to the first 3 layers of Hell. The rest of the game, such as ability unlocks and challenge modes/daily run are only available in the full version.</p>","developers":["Hidden Roll"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3944070","name":"Blunderworld"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4077620/fc1badd5580cd9f62d3ebe5a0b7783d1466221fb/header.jpg?t=1760413047","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Blunderworld Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 580 / AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Re